{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/770565-what-kinds-of-lessons-do-you-teach","id":770565,"title":"What kinds of lessons do you teach?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-20T23:37:01-08:00","id":770565,"title":"What kinds of lessons do you teach?","content":"What kinds of lessons fit which kind of hunger? I Get &quot;Hunger for punishment&quot; Is easyiest, to portray in a positive fashion...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T05:32:57-08:00","id":770674,"title":"","content":"Collector / Ravager - &quot;Don't get attached to material goods, all is passing, treasure them while you can.&quot;<br /> Tyrant - &quot;Know your limits.&quot; (Pose as a rival to surpass)<br /> Nemesis / Predator - &quot;Crime doesn't pay. You won't get away.&quot;<br /> <br /> While the idea of feeding your Hunger is a good one, I really hate trying to focus on the arbitrary division between them - its easy to have a hunger that crosses several categories, since you're required to customize your personal Hunger anyways. Someone that hunts down criminals could easily be a Nemesis, a Predator, or a Ravager. Hells, she could even be a Collector - gathering up criminals and keeping them in jail, or a Tyrant that is pushing the hierarchy of Law and Order on criminals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T16:09:53-08:00","id":771026,"title":"","content":"ok My char concept wants to bring down hucksters and conmen... <br /> <br /> I got CONNED in a moment of unspeakable stupidity, into giving some alleged &quot;Microsoft tech&quot; access to my computer<br /> <br /> he was slick, and good<br /> <br /> <br /> And my computers owner was password locked... <br /> thought I'd take out my frustration with a beast concept...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T19:53:40-08:00","id":771162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/770565-what-kinds-of-lessons-do-you-teach?p=771026#post771026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok My char concept wants to bring down hucksters and conmen...<br /> <br /> I got CONNED in a moment of unspeakable stupidity, into giving some alleged &quot;Microsoft tech&quot; access to my computer<br /> <br /> he was slick, and good<br /> <br /> <br /> And my computers owner was password locked...<br /> thought I'd take out my frustration with a beast concept...</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on how you want to approach it nemesis is obviously the best for just hunting down and punishing people. Now onto lessons. Payback is a b*tch is always fun, but I imagine most STs might object to that being your primary theme for lessons. Well a swarm type namtaru might go with the old &quot;the smallest worm will turn when trodden upon.&quot; Oh a fun tyrant one would be choose your targets very carefully. Don't prey on those you will eventually need is also a possibility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T22:33:10-08:00","id":771241,"title":"","content":"Still want to do a Beast that's a riff on Tyler Durden. The majority of the character's easy, just need to nail down his Hunger. Thinking either Nemesis or Ravager, because the other 3 just don't work.<br /> <br /> Or a Nemesis Clyde Shelton, although there, the challenge is pinning down the Family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":1959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","user":"Hexmeister Vic","date":". 11-22-2015, 01:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T04:16:04-08:00","id":771380,"title":"","content":"I usually use my Legend as a guide. I find that it helps a lot.<br /> <br /> And, remeber. - lessons are just how Beasts justify their sadistic feedings. You don't need to define a lesson for the character if you try to keep your punishment to those who've earned it with their bad karma. Actually, you don't even need that much, but its recommended for non-evil-depraved characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T09:44:57-08:00","id":771546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/770565-what-kinds-of-lessons-do-you-teach?p=771380#post771380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And, remeber. - lessons are just how Beasts justify their sadistic feedings.</div> </div> </div> </div>More neutrally phrased, it's an exhortation by the more socially-conscious end of Beast culture to remember that their predations have an impact and that humanity is going to learn <i>something</i> from them; from that perspective, curating your legend is just good sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T19:52:52-08:00","id":772014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/770565-what-kinds-of-lessons-do-you-teach?p=771026#post771026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok My char concept wants to bring down hucksters and conmen...<br /> <br /> I got CONNED in a moment of unspeakable stupidity, into giving some alleged &quot;Microsoft tech&quot; access to my computer<br /> <br /> he was slick, and good<br /> <br /> <br /> And my computers owner was password locked...<br /> thought I'd take out my frustration with a beast concept...</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on how mad you are, you could do it as a Predator, too. Hunt down those who live by trickery, and teach them (if only fleetingly) that it crumbles before naked force.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T22:57:45-08:00","id":772103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vithrir</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am a big supporter of the complete abandonment of the idea of teaching any kind of lesson. &quot;We're teaching Important Aesops by feeding on people&quot; is an almost pathetically flimsy and obvious lie to begin with. You are a monster. Your Hunger needs no more justification than your need to drink water or your need to partake of mortal food.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, just because you're not teaching doesn't mean they're not learning.<br /> <br /> Your opinion on the concept is known and this is the complete opposite of an appropriate thread for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T23:24:54-08:00","id":772111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/770565-what-kinds-of-lessons-do-you-teach?p=772103#post772103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your opinion on the concept is known and this is the complete opposite of an appropriate thread for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're...<br /> Huh. You're right.<br /> Okay. So now that I am reading this thread more carefully, it is not actually the thread I thought it was, and the content of the original post and the various replies to it are not what I thought they were. I have removed my previous post. My bad.<br /> ... not sure if sleep deprivation, or if this is what going crazy feels like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T08:41:21-07:00","id":849736,"title":"","content":"Have you ever heard the phrase, &quot;A friend is someone who'll help you move, while a real friend is someone who'll help you move a body?&quot; Most people go through their whole lives without knowing who they can really count on - who'll stand by them when an invisible hell invades their lives. But now you do. So hold them close, and deserve them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}